  "description": "Do you remember the problems you studied in high school?\n\n“You probably learned this before.”\n“I kind of remember it.”\nEven questions that seem familiar may turn out to be harder than expected,\nor things you may have already forgotten.\n\nThis game is an academic knowledge check quiz\nbased on subjects taught in high school.\n\nJapanese, mathematics, science, and social studies.\nFrom basic questions learned at school to problems that make you think,\nyou’ll face a variety of high school–level questions in quiz form.\n\nHow to play is simple.\n・Read the question  \n・Choose the answer by intuition  \n・Understand instantly with the result and explanation  \n\nEven if you answer correctly, you can’t let your guard down.\nEven if you’re wrong, every question offers a satisfying “aha!” moment.\n\nPlay one question at a time whenever you like.\nPerfect for passing time or checking your knowledge.\n\nHow much of your academic ability still holds up?\n\nIf you can solve them, that’s impressive.\nWhy not challenge this comprehensive high school–level test?\n\nーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー\nTT supports game streaming by video creators.\nBoth individuals and organizations are free to stream this game without obtaining permission from TT.",
